<view class="page kitchen-page"><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner">本地演练 · 厨房与朋友都在本机</view><block wx:if="{{creating}}"><view class="eyebrow">给一桌好饭起个名字</view><view class="title">建一间小厨房</view><view class="card"><view class="label">厨房名称</view><input class="input" maxlength="32" placeholder="例如：周末的小厨房" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">想对朋友说</view><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="160" placeholder="来吃饭，顺便聊聊最近的生活。" value="{{description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="muted">新厨房仅你自己可见。以后发起饭局，再邀请朋友加入。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||!name}}" bindtap="create">厨房准备好了</button></block><view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在打开厨房…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card"><view>{{error}}</view><button bindtap="refresh" class="secondary">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{kitchen}}"><view class="kitchen-header"><view class="eyebrow">{{kitchen.role==='owner'?'我的厨房':kitchen.role==='cook'?'一起掌勺的厨房':'朋友的厨房'}}</view><view class="title">{{kitchen.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{kitchen.description||'把熟悉的味道，做给熟悉的人。'}}</view><button wx:if="{{kitchen.role==='owner'}}" class="link-button edit-kitchen" bindtap="editKitchen">{{editing?'收起编辑':'编辑厨房资料'}}⌄</button></view><view wx:if="{{editing&&kitchen.role==='owner'}}" class="card"><view class="label">厨房名称</view><input class="input" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input" maxlength="32"/><view class="label">想对朋友说</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="input" maxlength="160"/><image wx:if="{{imageUrl}}" class="cover-preview" src="{{imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button wx:if="{{mediaAvailable}}" class="secondary" bindtap="cover" disabled="{{busy}}">选择厨房封面</button><view wx:else class="muted">照片功能准备中，先把厨房介绍写好吧。</view><view wx:if="{{imageId}}"><text class="muted">{{imageStatus==='approved'?'封面已就绪':'封面等待审核'}}</text><button wx:if="{{imageStatus!=='approved'}}" class="link-button" bindtap="checkCover">查看审核结果</button><button class="link-button" bindtap="clearCover">移除封面</button></view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveKitchen" disabled="{{busy}}">保存厨房资料</button></view><view wx:if="{{kitchen.role!=='member'}}" class="row kitchen-actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="add">＋ 记一道拿手菜</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="publish">发起饭局</button></view><view class="segmented"><view class="segment {{panel==='recipes'?'active':''}}" data-panel="recipes" bindtap="choosePanel">菜谱 {{dishes.length}}</view><view class="segment {{panel==='history'?'active':''}}" data-panel="history" bindtap="choosePanel">饭局 {{meals.length}}</view><view wx:if="{{kitchen.role==='owner'}}" class="segment {{panel==='members'?'active':''}}" data-panel="members" bindtap="choosePanel">朋友 {{kitchen.members.length}}</view></view><block wx:if="{{panel==='recipes'}}"><input class="management-search" placeholder="找菜名或食材" value="{{search}}" bindinput="searchInput"/><view class="filter-row"><view class="filter-chip {{dishFilter==='all'?'active':''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="filterInput">全部菜谱</view><view class="filter-chip {{dishFilter==='active'?'active':''}}" data-filter="active" bindtap="filterInput">可以点</view><view class="filter-chip {{dishFilter==='inactive'?'active':''}}" data-filter="inactive" bindtap="filterInput">已下架</view></view><view wx:if="{{!visibleDishes.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">{{dishes.length?'没有找到这道菜':'从第一道拿手菜开始'}}</view><view>{{dishes.length?'换个词或筛选条件看看。':'记下食材和做法，下次就不用翻找了。'}}</view></view><view class="recipe-management-row" wx:for="{{visibleDishes}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit"><view class="recipe-mini">{{item.name[0]}}</view><view class="flex"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.category_name}} · {{item.minutes}} 分钟</view><view wx:if="{{kitchen.can_price}}" class="recipe-price">内部参考 ¥ {{item.price}}</view></view><view class="recipe-state"><text class="tag {{item.active?'':'inactive-tag'}}">{{item.active?'可点':'已下架'}}</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view></block><block wx:if="{{panel==='history'}}"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">每一顿的记录</view><button class="link-button" bindtap="history">查看全部 ›</button></view><view wx:if="{{!meals.length}}" class="card empty"><view class="empty-title">第一顿饭，等你来安排。</view><view>约个时间，把想吃的菜交给大家选。</view></view><view class="card compact" wx:for="{{meals}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><text class="flex dish-name">{{item.title}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.label}}</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view></block><block wx:if="{{panel==='members'&&kitchen.role==='owner'}}"><view class="muted">厨房身份和每顿饭的接单厨师分别管理。转让主人、移出朋友都需要确认。</view><view class="card member-card"><view class="list-row" wx:for="{{kitchen.members}}" wx:key="id"><view class="member-avatar">{{item.name[0]}}</view><view class="flex"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.role==='owner'?'厨房主人':item.role==='cook'?'协作厨师':'一起吃饭的朋友'}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{item.role!=='owner'}}" class="link-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="member">管理</button></view></view></block><view class="kitchen-leave"><button class="text-danger" bindtap="leave">{{kitchen.role==='owner'?'关闭这个厨房':'离开这个厨房'}}</button></view></block></view>
